id: pm-context-empty-prepared-release
title: Abandon prepared releases without usable notes and validate the exact new section
description: "Daily Release run 43010114851 repeatedly resumes untagged 2f226a2 (2026.11.1), whose changelog has no matching section. Preserve explicit immutable recovery and valid prepared transactions, but allow current-day work after an empty prepared release."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-11-11T21:55:31.608Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-12T16:33:37.556Z"
closed_at: "2026-11-12T16:33:37.540Z"
completed_at: "2026-11-12T16:33:37.540Z"
author: codex-release-repair-1111
resolution: Implemented and merged in #224 (6b15479).
expected_result: The change described by this item is on main.
actual_result: "Merged in #224 as 6b15479; checks successful at head a9a0eaa: CodeQL, codeql, semgrep-cloud-platform/scan, test (22), test (26)."
comments[14]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-11T21:55:44.005Z",codex-release-repair-1111,"Root cause confirmed in job 130487299785: oldest untagged Release commit 2f226a2 is selected every day and checked out before restoration; it lacks 2026.11.1. Its generation used --limit 1 plus a nonempty-file check, so an older heading passed. Later main notes roll forward with dependency commits after preparation and do not identify the immutable artifact. Skip untagged candidates without usable same-version content unless explicit recovery is requested; require exact substantive notes during generation and recovery. No tags changed and no dispatch performed."
  "2026-11-11T21:57:16.940Z",codex-release-repair-1111,"Revert proof: independently removing only the selection guard or restoring only the old generation block in disposable copies makes its behavioral regression fail (1 failure each); fixed suite passes. Added placeholder/header-only restoration refusals. Focused workflow readers, YAML verifier and source/test typechecks are the scoped gates; no npm lint script is configured, so verify:release-workflow is the workflow lint gate. CI certifies the full gate. No recovery dispatch is needed for this abandonment path."
  "2026-11-11T22:08:26.477Z",codex-release-repair-1111,"Review follow-up: one shared workflow-owned notes extractor now handles CRLF, HTML comments, thematic breaks and duplicate headings consistently across selection, generation and restoration. Registry lookup permits abandonment only after a definitive E404; a published version or an unknown registry outcome is retained/refused. Explicit recovery bypass applies only to an ancestor candidate whose version has usable notes in the authorized main commit. Added real pinned-generator coverage for padded tags and substantive content."
  "2026-11-11T22:10:21.713Z",codex-release-repair-1111,"Final review validation: all 70 workflow-reader tests pass with zero failures/skips, including real locked-generator padded-tag output, published-version retention, E503 fail-closed lookup, later explicit recovery, CRLF/comment/decoration-only refusals and duplicate section refusal. Source/test typechecks and YAML verifier pass. Behavioral selection and generation reverts were rerun in disposable copies. Review threads remain open for orchestrator replies."
  "2026-11-12T00:00:10.840Z",codex-release-repair-1111,"Round 2: read PRRT_kwDOSzDuFs62Zt1w and PRRT_kwDOSzDuFs62ZNtn in full. Worktree is clean; origin/main has no commits missing from this branch, so no merge is needed. Reserve all preparation coordinates during allocation, scan newest resumable preparation first, replace shell -c test invocations with argument-array script-file execution, and restore an actionable exact-tag notes error. Keep previous registry/recovery invariants and add behavioral revert proofs."
  "2026-11-12T00:10:55.008Z",codex-release-repair-1111,"Round 2 focused gate passes 10/10. Revert proofs in disposable copies: reverting only allocation fails the publish-before-tag retry, single-empty must-allow and normalized-suffix tests (3 failures); reverting only newest-first selection fails the duplicate-shadowing test. Source/test typechecks and YAML verifier pass. Every process launch in the changed test and its helpers uses argument arrays and explicit shell:false; actual workflow execution uses a script-file operand, including a fixture path containing spaces, quotes and shell metacharacters. Local CodeQL executable is unavailable; CI must certify that finding."
  "2026-11-12T00:12:19.037Z",codex-release-repair-1111,"Round 2 final scoped gate: all 74 workflow-reader tests pass, zero failures/skips; source/test typechecks and workflow YAML verifier pass. Reverting only the tagged/prepared allocation block fails 3 tests including both requested scenarios; reverting only selection ordering fails the newest-duplicate test; reverting only the notes diagnostic block fails its exact-tag error assertion. No shell -c remains in the changed test or its helpers. The real generator fixture passes with spaces, quotes and literal shell metacharacters in its directory name. CodeQL must be checked by CI because the CLI is not installed locally. Threads remain open for orchestrator replies."
  "2026-11-12T00:18:42.393Z",codex-release-repair-1111,"Final exact-head review surfaced a direct newest-first regression: an explicitly authorized older notes recovery could be skipped for a newer usable preparation. Preserve explicit recovery precedence by resolving its needed version before applying newest-first selection within that coordinate. Add coverage where the recovery changelog contains both old and new sections, and retain newest valid duplicate preference. Reopen no items and leave review threads untouched."
  "2026-11-12T00:21:05.679Z",codex-release-repair-1111,"Additional thread PRRT_kwDOSzDuFs62aTDy: explicit recovery resolves a covered coordinate still needing notes before normal newest-first selection, then selects the newest preparation within that coordinate. Regression covers an older missing section with both newer usable and newer missing preparations; the recovery changelog includes both versions. A newer usable duplicate of the target coordinate remains preferred. Removing only recovery precedence fails the older-recovery regression. Final full workflow-reader gate passes 76/76, zero failures/skips; source/test typechecks and YAML verifier pass. No thread replies or resolutions were sent."
  "2026-11-12T08:00:37.530Z",codex-agent,"Round 3 scoped to PRRT_kwDOSzDuFs62erle. Fetched every unresolved thread with all comments and the latest CodeRabbit body; exactly this one thread is unresolved, comment pagination is complete, and the latest review has no outside-diff findings. The branch is clean, matches its remote head, and has no missing main commits. Verify the shared RELEASE_NOTES_AWK consumer paths and reject marker-only/bulleted-placeholder sections while retaining real bullets and non-list paragraphs. Keep prior fixes unchanged."
  "2026-11-12T08:07:07.347Z",codex-agent,"Verified PRRT_kwDOSzDuFs62erle against code. The shared parser now strips Markdown list markers before whitespace normalization and refuses marker-only remnants and the No changes. placeholder. Self-review covers nested, plus and numbered markers in the same predicate. A shared corpus exercises heading-only, empty dash/star bullets and bulleted placeholders, plus real bullets and non-list paragraphs through the parser, selection, generation and restoration. Behavioral revert in a disposable copy fails four independent tests (shared policy and all three consumers); fixed test file passes 13/13, zero skips. Required compatibility cases remain allowed. Typechecks and workflow verifier pass. Previous CI jobs ran both npm/Bun release gates in 11–15 minutes total excluding queue time, so attempt each full local gate sequentially with a 1200-second cap."
  "2026-11-12T08:35:10.049Z",codex-agent,"Round 3 final results: targeted test file 13/13; all workflow readers 77/77; identity audit 4/4; zero failures/skips. The behavioral revert changes only RELEASE_NOTES_AWK and fails four tests: shared predicate, preparation selection, notes generation and restoration; restored implementation passes. Full npm run release:check passes 484/484 in 924 seconds and bun run release:check passes 484/484 in 683 seconds, each under its 1200-second cap. Native coverage reports all 18 configured source files at unchanged thresholds; c8 thresholds also pass. Production audits report zero vulnerabilities. Clean dist rebuild is byte-current and needs no committed output changes. Typecheck, test typecheck and workflow verifier pass. Inherited-extension health reproduces existing pm-context-595f; strict health with the same flags and an isolated CI-style home passes. No pins or historical audit records changed. Only PRRT_kwDOSzDuFs62erle was unresolved and no outside-diff findings appeared in the latest CodeRabbit body. No review replies, resolutions, merges or releases performed."
  "2026-11-12T11:22:03.165Z",codex,"author=steve-orchestrator,text=Greptile PRRT_kwDOSzDuFs62iKbP (release.yml:67): the notes policy removed list markers and whitespace and then treated any leading # as a heading, so '- #123 fixes the release retry' was refused as empty. A heading is now detected after list markers are stripped and before whitespace is removed (#-run plus whitespace or end). Added must-allow cases '- #123 …' and '#123 …' and must-refuse cases '#', '- ### Fixed' and '   ### Fixed'. test/release-empty-preparation.test.ts passes 13/13, and 4 tests fail with the workflow change reverted. The release workflow tests pass 33/33."
  "2026-11-12T14:26:34.862Z",steve-orchestrator,"Orchestrator, review thread PRRT_kwDOSzDuFs62mXTn (CodeRabbit, release.yml): npm 11 refuses a prerelease on the default tag, and same-day suffix releases (2026.11.11-1) are semver prereleases, so the recovery path could never publish. publish_with_provenance now passes --tag latest explicitly, as pm-changelog's release does; a suffix release is the newest release. Regression in test/release-workflow.test.ts (already linked) runs the workflow's own function with the real npm in dry-run mode: the suffix case and its stable twin publish as latest, and a harness twin without the tag is refused by npm 11. Reverting the tag fails the suffix case with npm's refusal. release-workflow 17/17, typecheck, verify:release-workflow, docstring and changelog:check pass."
